BOINC ops pages: clearer user administration.

- manage_user.php: project preferences per venue (Default/Home/School/Work, as
  volunteers see them in the column view), the user's computers with their venue and
  which preferences apply to each, a status message after updating the special user
  status or a suspension; fixes a PHP 8 error when sending suspension emails
- manage_special_users.php / _action.php: redirect back with a status message instead
  of printing the SQL query; fixes broken HTML in the user rows
- list_new_users.php: users by registration date, one line per user, click to expand
  (account, special status, preferences per venue, computers), paging
- new html/inc/ops_user.inc with the shared helpers

